et the principal component graph? I have tried several basic R options but none have worked for me. Thanks and regards</span><br></pre><div>Daryl David Cruz Flores<br>PhD Candidate<br>Centro de Investigación en Biodiversidad y Conservación (CIByC)<br>Universidad Autónoma del Estado de Morelos (UAEM), México</div></div>\r\n</blockquote></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p></blockquote></div>"
